-- הסכם עוז לתמורה (14.8.2011), נספח א'1: the work-week tables of a mother
-- teacher in the reform's part application in תשע"ב (§26(ד) sends to it):
-- for each age band, a table under §11(א) (she cuts her hours) and one
-- under §11(ב) (she keeps the week she would have had); the 60-minute hour
-- of their presence; their note on frontal hours that are not whole.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT vocabulary
IMPORT `oz-founding-common`
IMPORT `oz-founding-9`

§ `נספח א'1`

-- "מורה אם לפי סעיף ___ (א)" and its table: a mother under 50 who cuts her
-- hours under §11(א). The caption leaves the section's number blank, as
-- annex א's do, where the corpus reads it as §11; in part application
-- §26(ד) sends to it. Each column is the position she would have had, her
-- week and the position she is paid on.
@ref akn:att_2__hc_1/p1 akn:att_2__hc_1/p2 akn:att_2__hc_1/t1
`the (א) table of annex א'1 under 50` MEANS
    `Oz annexed table` WITH
        `the annex printing it`  IS "נספח א'1"
        `the age band it is for` IS `the Oz band under 50`
        `what it is for`         IS `a mother cutting her hours, section 11(א)`
        `its columns`            IS LIST
            `an Oz annexed mother's column` (103.60%) (100.00%) 23 2 3.5 28.5,
            `an Oz annexed mother's column` (100.27%) (95.00%) 22 2 3.5 27.5,
            `an Oz annexed mother's column` (95.27%) (91.67%) 21 2 3 26,
            `an Oz annexed mother's column` (91.93%) (86.67%) 20 2 3 25,
            `an Oz annexed mother's column` (86.93%) (83.33%) 19 1.5 3 23.5

